+    // T-Remesher native adaptive density.
+    // File format:
+    //   <patch_count>
+    //   <multiplier patch 0>
+    //   <multiplier patch 1>
+    //   ...
+    // Multiplier < 1.0 requests smaller target edges (more quads).
